{"id":15160,"date":"2023-03-02T10:10:25","date_gmt":"2023-03-02T17:10:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=resources&#038;p=15160"},"modified":"2024-01-17T17:39:27","modified_gmt":"2024-01-18T00:39:27","slug":"strategies-maximizing-productivity-work-enjoyment-human-services","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/strategies-maximizing-productivity-work-enjoyment-human-services\/","title":{"rendered":"Strategies for Maximizing One\u2019s Productivity and Work Enjoyment in Human Services"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"15160\" class=\"elementor elementor-15160\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-618e461 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"618e461\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ec7b9d3\" data-id=\"ec7b9d3\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7539d9f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7539d9f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0;\">About this Webinar<\/h2><p>Dr. Bridget Taylor hosts Dr. Dennis Reid to talk about self-motivation for practitioners.<\/p><p><em><strong>This webinar is eligible for 1 General CE.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorlive.com\/courses\/strategies-for-maximizing-ones-productivity-and-work-enjoyment-in-human-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>View On-Demand Webinar<\/strong><\/a><\/p><h3>Our Next Guest: A Conversation with Dr. Bridget Taylor &amp; Dr. Dennis Reid<\/h3><p>This webinar will discuss how human service practitioners can achieve and maintain self-motivation to be professionally productive and experience enjoyment on the job during the best and worst of times. Self-motivation will be presented in terms of practitioners actively using strategies developed through research and application in behavior analysis and therapy to promote their work <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/our-solutions\/practice-management\/\">productivity<\/a> and enjoyment.<\/p><p><strong>Examples of self-motivation strategies to be discussed include:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Goal setting<\/li><li>Self-recording<\/li><li>Self-reinforcement<\/li><li>Specific ways to promote enjoyment during unpleasant work situations (e.g., when working with unrealistic caseloads or working for a problematic supervisor)<\/li><\/ul><h2>Learning Objectives<\/h2><p>At the conclusion of the presentation, participants will be able to:<\/p><ol><li>Define self-motivation in a manner readily applicable for working practitioners.<\/li><li>Describe a basic self-motivation strategy for wide-scale application.<\/li><li>Name two advantages of short-term goals relative to long-term goals for maintaining self-motivation on a day-to-day and week-to-week basis.<\/li><\/ol><h2>About the Guest Speaker<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-139fb16 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"139fb16\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-521e2df\" data-id=\"521e2df\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92565ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"92565ba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/dr-dennis-reid.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15086\" alt=\"Headshot of Dr. Dennis Reid\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/dr-dennis-reid.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/dr-dennis-reid-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/dr-dennis-reid-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-387727f\" data-id=\"387727f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ad189a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ad189a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Dr. Dennis Reid, BCBA-D<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Author<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Over 45 years of experience as a clinician and supervisor in educational, residential, and community support settings for people with intellectual and developmental disabilities including autism, and has consulted with human service agencies in the majority of states of the United States as well as Canada, Australia, and New Zealand. He has published over 140 refereed journal articles and book chapters focusing on applied behavior analysis and authored or co-authored 15 books.<\/p>\n<p>In 2007 Dennis was awarded Fellowship status in the Association for Behavior Analysis International and in 2006 received the American Association on Intellectual and Developmental Disabilities International Research Award. Dennis is the founder and current director of the Carolina Behavior Analysis and Support Center in Morganton, North Carolina.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":18643,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Our Next Guest - Self-motivation for Practitioners","_seopress_titles_desc":"Free webinar eligible for 1 General CE covering how human service practitioners can achieve &amp; maintain self-motivation, professional productivity &amp; enjoyment.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[329,230],"resource-tag":[307,287,174,103],"class_list":["post-15160","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-behavior","resource-topic-research","resource-tag-application","resource-tag-continuing-education","resource-tag-goals","resource-tag-objective"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/15160","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/15160\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/18643"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=15160"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"audience","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/audience?post=15160"},{"taxonomy":"resource-type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-type?post=15160"},{"taxonomy":"resource-topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-topic?post=15160"},{"taxonomy":"resource-tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-tag?post=15160"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}